# - Pre-SWA force RMSEs of the ablation (0.081 eV/A for both runs; Table 4) are intermediate checkpoints and are not encoded. The ablation 'with Cu-MOF MD' model has different validation errors from uMOF-MH in Table 3 (37.3 vs 33.2 meV/atom), so it is kept as a separate run.
# - The h5_mofgen augmentation set (37,732 train and 4,192 validation frames from MOFGen structures) degraded downstream accuracy and is not in the released models; it is not encoded as a training set.
